        {
          "text": "Ũũ nĩw’o Yeova ũnũkwasya, Valũa wa kũtaanĩsya wa mwenyu, ũla namũekie naw’o, ũĩva? Kana nũũ wa ala manandũaa ũla namũthooisye inyw’ĩ kwake? Sisya, nũndũ wa mothũku menyu nĩmwathooiw’e, na nũndũ wa mavĩtyo menyu mwenyu nĩwaekiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.1"
            ]
