        {
          "text": "Nũndũ Mwĩaĩi Yeova akandethya; kwondũ wa ũu ndyaathokoana: kwondũ wa ũu nĩnĩlũmĩtye ũthyũ wakwa ta ĩvia yũmũ, na nĩnĩsĩ ndikasonokw’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.7"
            ]
          }
